            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[**Homebrew update counts are consistent between the menu bar and Workbench.** Homebrew details now list dependencies that Upgrade All can include, with available versions when reported.

**Update details open from their info icons.** Tool warnings and exact download sizes are easier to read.

**DuoUpdater now finds and installs official Videoquetsche updates.**
]]></description>
